# raidar: the Keras engine raidar's keras detectors run on, and the dataset root its configs expand

# KERAS_BACKEND=torch   torch | tensorflow | jax — the engine Keras 3 runs on, read at import time; raidar's tensorflow module pins tensorflow, the keras backend never sets it (README → The shared FCOS spec)
# DATA_ROOT=/path/to/datasets   folder holding the datasets; a config path written `$DATA_ROOT/<dataset>` is expanded when it loads, an unset one is refused (README → The rfdetr backend)
